  <table width="100%" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
    <tr>
      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<h1 class="govd_header" style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;">Update Your ACTIVENet Password Today</h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Columbus Recreation and Parks Department has upgraded its ACTIVENet system, where residents sign up to register for classes and camps and rent event venues. The system is live, and <a href="https://anc.apm.activecommunities.com/columbusrecparks1/home?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">you can now update your ACTIVENet password</a>!</p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin-top: 0px;">If you have not used ACTIVENet in 2025, you will need to create a new account.</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin-bottom: 15px;">If you used ACTIVENet in 2025, you don’t need to create a new account, but you will need to update your password.</li>
</ul>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">You can create a new account or update your password when you log into the new ACTIVENet starting today. It’s recommended you do this before registering for the next session so you are ready.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">When going to the home page for ACTIVENet, click on the yellow Sign In/Up button. From there, you can either update your password or create a new ACTIVENet account.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://columbusrecparks.com/connect/about/capital-improvement-projects/activenet-update/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">Learn more about next steps, and review frequently asked questions</a>.</p>
<table class="govd_button" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-bottom: 15px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;" align="center"><tbody><tr><td class="govd_button" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background-color: #e31b23; border-radius: 5px; text-align: center; display: inline-block; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; padding: 10px; border: none;" align="center" bgcolor="#e31b23"><a href="https://anc.apm.activecommunities.com/columbusrecparks1/home?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-decoration: none !important;"><strong style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none;">Update Your ACTIVENet Password</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>
